# Old HubSpot URLs. Order matters — Netlify stops at the first match. /blog → /writing.
/blog                /writing    301
/blog/*               /writing   301
/starter-package     /           301
/premium-package     /           301

# Trailing-slash redirects after build.format 'file' (see docs/site-consolidation.md).
# /writing/<slug>/ has no splat rule (Netlify splat is end-only); relies on pretty-URL normalization to .html.
/writing/             /writing    301
/about/               /about      301
/contact/             /contact    301
/thanks/              /thanks     301
